{"type":"corollary","type_name":"Corollary","number":"23.3.2","title":"Bootstrap intervals are first-order correct","title_html":"Bootstrap intervals are first-order correct","html":"<p>Under the conditions of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-bs-residual\">@thm-bs-residual</span>, the percentile and\nbasic intervals built from the residual bootstrap have coverage\nprobability tending to <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"1-\\alpha\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FC TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch23-resampling-inference/03-confidence-intervals.html"}